          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.317,
            0.834,
            0.382
          ],
          "content": "a. Does the outer boundary of the picture have reflection symmetry? If so, draw the lines of symmetries. How many are they?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.386,
            0.833,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "b. Does it have rotational symmetry around its centre? If so, find the angles of rotational symmetry."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.431,
            0.834,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "8. How many lines of symmetry do the shapes in the first shape sequence in Chapter 1, Table 3, the Regular Polygons, have? What number sequence do you get?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.5,
            0.833,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": "9. How many angles of symmetry do the shapes in the first shape sequence in Chapter 1, Table 3, the Regular Polygons, have? What number sequence do you get?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.568,
            0.833,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": "10. How many lines of symmetry do the shapes in the last shape sequence in Chapter 1, Table 3, the Koch Snowflake sequence, have? How many angles of symmetry?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.636,
            0.671,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": "11. How many lines of symmetry and angles of symmetry does Ashoka Chakra have?"
        },
        {
